<title>FRANCE: Natwest Sellier issues &quot;Hold&quot; on Oreal.</title>
<headline>Natwest Sellier issues &quot;Hold&quot; on Oreal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broker Natwest Sellier has changed its recommendation on L'Oreal to &quot;Hold&quot; from &quot;Accumulate&quot;, saying the share is overvalued, fund managers said.</p>
<p>The change in recommendation was included in a study on European growth stocks.</p>
<p>At 1535, l'Oreal was down 2.17 percent at 1,759 francs.</p>
</text>
